              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yere 46:2-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka walengele ikumi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu mwaka walengele ikumi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Emukuti, pashala imyaka imyanda isano, na makumi yatatu na cine konse konse, pakuti Kristu ese (538 BC).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " pa bushiku ubwalenga ikumi limo na shibili (12), mu mweshi walenga ikumi, ishiwi lyakwa Yawe lyaishile kuli ine aliti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“We mwana wa muntu, kaseseme ukalipile Farao, imfumu ya mu Egupto, useseme na ku bena Egupto bonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamusoke Farao ukuti ifi efyasosa Imfumu Yawe ati, ‘Ine ndi mulwani obe nomba, iwe Farao imfumu ya ku Egupto, we cishimweshimwe, we ulala mu mumana. Iwe ulaitakisha auti, “Umumana wa Nailo mumana wandi, nine naupanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine nalaswa nkukofye icinkobwe mu nsekete shobe, ndeke ne sabi lya mu mumana obe lilefyantama mu maŋongwa yobe. Elyo nkulompwele na ku mulundu wa mumana wa Nailo, ninshi ne sabi nalifyantama mu maŋongwa yobe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkakusha mu matololo, iwe pamo ne sabi lya mu milonga yobe. Ukaponena panshi no kushala insansalila, takwakabe uwakukwimya nangu ukukushiika. Nkakucita icakulya ca nama sha mpanga ne fyuni fya mu lwelele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.36.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esaya 36:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo abekala mu Egupto bonse bakeshiba ukuti kanshi ine nine Yawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Lelo imwe mwalifye nge nkonto ye tete ku ba ŋanda yakwa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo balemwikata mu minwe yabo mwalesantauka, no kubacenaula amabeya yabo. Ilyo bashintilila pali imwe mwalefunika, mwalenga ne myendo yabo ukusokona.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi ifi efyasosa Imfumu Yawe ati, ‘Nkamuletela abalwani abakumwipaya ku lupanga, bakesa mwipaya bonse kumo kwine ne fitekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icalo ca Egupto cikasanguka amatololo. Elyo mukashininkisha ukuti kanshi ine nine Yawe.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Pa mulandu wakuti iwe Farao waleti umumana wa Nailo e cuma cobe, nokuti niwe waupanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala ine nomba ninkwalukila, ninjalukila ne milonga ya Nailo ine. Icalo ca Egupto nkacisangula amatololo kabili icaonaika umushaba kantu ukutula ku musumba wa Migidoli ukuyafye na ku musumba wa Siene,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Siene:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "E musumba wa mu Egupto, uwabelele ku kapinda ka ku kulyo, e musumba umwaleikala abena Israeli abengi. Mu nshiku shesu tutila Aswani.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mpaka ukuya shintafye na mu mipaka ya calo ca Kushi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kushi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "E calo icali lwa ku ntulo ya mumana wa Nailo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tamwakatale amumoneka lukasa lwa muntu nangufye ulwa nama. Tamwakekale muntu nangufye inama pa myaka amakumi yane (40). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa fyalo fyonse ifyo ine nasangula amatololo, icalo ca Egupto cena eco nkacishapo. Imisumba ya mu Egupto ikashala ifibolya pa myaka amakumi yane (40), nafyo ifibolya fikabipisha no kucila imisumba yonse iyaonaika. Abena Egupto nkabasalanganya, bakabutukila mu fyalo fyonse, no kulaikala na bantu ba mishobo imbi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ifi efyasosa Imfumu Yawe ati, ‘Imyaka amakumi yane (40) nga yapwa, elyo nkalonganya abena Egupto, nkabafumya mu bantu ba mishobo imbi umo nabasalanganishishe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaleka bakekale mu Egupto, lubali lwa ku kapinda ka ku kuso, mu ka calo ka Patirosi umo ifikolwe fyabo fyatuntwike. Emo bakakwatila ubufumu ubwacepesha nganshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pantu bukasaluka ukucila ubufumu bumbi bonse, kabili tabakatale abateekapo abantu ba mishobo imbi nakalya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba ŋanda yakwa Israeli tabakatale nakabili abaposako amano ku bena Egupto, cikabashinina aba ŋanda yakwa Israeli ukuti kanshi balubilefye ilyo babikile amano ku bena Egupto. Kanshi elyo bakeshiba ukuti nine Imfumu Yawe.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka walengele amakumi yabili na cine lubali (27),",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu mwaka walengele amakumi yabili na cine lubali:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Emukuti, pashala imyaka imyanda isano na makumi cine lubali na umo pakuti Kristu ese (571 BC).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " pa bushiku bwakutampa umweshi wapakubala, ishiwi lyakwa Yawe lyaishile kuli ine aliti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“We mwana wa muntu, Nebukadinesa imfumu ya ku Babiloni nasansa umusumba wa Turi. Abashilika bakwe babombeshe na maka nganshi, icakuti ne mitwe yabo naikusulukako imishishi yonse, na mabeya yabo yonse yakusulukile kumo, lelo imfumu pamo na bashilika baiko bene baicuushishefye, tabamwenepo kantu nakalya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi ifi efyasosa Imfumu Yawe ati, ‘Nalapeela imfumu Nebukadinesa icalo ca Egupto. Alatapa icalo, asende ne fyuma fyaciko fyonse, e malipilo ya fita fyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalamupeela icalo ca Egupto, ekumulambula pa mulimo wakwe, pantu ifita fyakwe filamombela ine.’ Efyasosa Imfumu Yawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
